his hopes for nothing?

802
01:28:20,878 --> 01:28:21,878
What then, huh?

803
01:28:22,130 --> 01:28:23,381
You have no compassion.

804
01:28:23,464 --> 01:28:25,174
What do you mean build
up his hopes for nothing?

805
01:28:25,258 --> 01:28:26,634
